# ========== LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ==========
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
VITE_API_TIMEOUT=30000
VITE_APP_NAME=Enterprise MCP Dashboard
VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0

# ========== VERCEL PRODUCTION ==========
# For Vercel deployment, set VITE_API_URL to your public backend URL
# Options:
# 1. ngrok: https://your-ngrok-url.ngrok.io
# 2. Cloudflare Tunnel: https://your-tunnel-domain.com
# 3. Your own production backend: https://api.yourdomain.com
#
# HOW TO SET IN VERCEL:
# 1. Go to vercel.com dashboard
# 2. Select "enterprise-mcp-exp" project
# 3. Settings → Environment Variables
# 4. Add: VITE_API_URL = [your-public-backend-url]
# 5. Redeploy
